    "faq_mnMDVa": {
      "type": "faq",
      "blocks": {
        "item_eCGL3r": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Why does “Heavy Duty” matter?",
            "content": "<p>Heavy-duty treadmills matter because they are built for <strong>higher weight capacity, stronger stability, and long-term durability</strong>.</p><p>Compared to standard models, they provide a <strong>reinforced frame and more powerful motor support</strong>, making them more suitable for <strong>daily running, intense workouts, and users who need extra stability and confidence during exercise</strong>. 🏃‍♂️</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_3AyCqb": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Who should use a heavy-duty treadmill?",
            "content": "<p>Heavy-duty treadmills are ideal for users who need a <strong>more solid and supportive machine for regular training</strong>.</p><p>They are especially suitable for <strong>taller users or heavier individuals</strong>, as well as anyone who prefers <strong>longer workouts, faster running speeds, or extra stability and confidence during exercise at home</strong>. 🏃‍♂️</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_zqDrUq": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Can they handle daily long workouts?",
            "content": "<p>Yes, heavy-duty treadmills are built for <strong>consistent daily use and longer training sessions</strong>.</p><p>They are designed with a <strong>durable frame and stable structure</strong>, allowing them to maintain smooth performance even during extended workouts at home.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_rQ798D": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Are the motors powerful enough for heavy use?",
            "content": "<p>Yes, heavy-duty treadmills are equipped with <strong>high-performance brushless motors</strong> designed to deliver <strong>strong and stable power output</strong>.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_7Mijxq": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Are heavy-duty treadmills noisy?",
            "content": "<p>No, they are designed to maintain a <strong>controlled and stable noise level</strong> even during higher-intensity workouts.</p><p>The <strong>brushless motor system and reinforced structure</strong> help reduce vibration, making them suitable for home use without causing major disturbance.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_XXL3KA": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How long is the warranty for WELLFIT products?",
